So the second day

262
00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:53.360
I have no doubt will be extremely difficult,

263
00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:56.960
I'm not like going in overconfident at all

264
00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:01.597
but I've got some electrolytes now.

265
00:11:01.597 --> 00:11:02.430
No, I was gonna ask you

266
00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.490
if you've been practicing your nutrition and hydration.

267
00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.500
I have, your sponsor sent me

