363
00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.020
I've never been a mountain biker,

364
00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:04.500
I've always been a roadie, but there's so much gravel

365
00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.330
and fire roads around where we live.

366
00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.350
So gravel bikes are good for fire roads

367
00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.053
and like those gravel road?

368
00:15:11.053 --> 00:15:13.678
They're not meant for like super technical

369
00:15:13.678 --> 00:15:15.650
sort of mountain biking

370
00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:19.070
where you're like jumping over rocks and things like that.

371
00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:22.620
The gravel bikes don't have like the shock absorption

372
00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:25.590
and that kind of like geometry, but they're great

373
00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:27.900
