375
00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.230
And that's been super fun

376
00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.610
and kind of a learning curve for me

377
00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:36.580
but it's opened up like a whole new world.

378
00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.520
So I rode from my house like I took down Mulholland

379
00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:42.780
all the way to and down Mandeville

380
00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.370
and like into Brentwood and around-

381
00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:45.203
From your house?

382
00:15:45.203 --> 00:15:46.036
Yeah.
That's amazing.

383
00:15:46.036 --> 00:15:47.430
Super fun.

384
00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:48.540
How long is that?

385
00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:52.220
It was like a 50 mile ride, I did like a big loop.

386
00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.150
That's fantastic.

387
00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:58.150
But here's the thing, so the Turbo Creo SL is an e-bike,

