00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.460
it's got a motor in it.

389
00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:04.360
(laughs) Is that the one you said?

390
00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:09.210
Yeah, so I took that and what's been cool and interesting

