00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:02.797
he also made the "Dissident",

414
00:17:02.797 --> 00:17:06.360
the Khashogghi doc that's out right now.

415
00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:11.360
And he was the one who got me excited about this Turbo Creo.

416
00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.330
He's like, "You got to get this bike,

417
00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:14.590
