00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.173
it's so fun, you end up riding longer.

420
00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.320
You ride more 'cause it's more fun

421
00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:25.920
and it allows you to go places you wouldn't ordinarily go.

422
00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:30.110
Like going up these fire roads that are crazy steep,

423
00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.750
