424
00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.160
you might not ride up

425
00:17:35.193 --> 00:17:37.660
and he said that he's like increased his riding,

426
00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.950
like I dunno, 30% from what he used to do

427
00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.870
because of this bike and he's able to go out longer.

428
00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.851
So do use it like selectively?

429
00:17:45.851 --> 00:17:48.340
Basically, I keep the motor on like the low,

430
00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:51.120
