431
00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:52.780
So I keep it, I either turn it off

432
00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:54.250
or I keep it on the lowest rung

433
00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.110
and it just gives you a little bit of kick.

434
00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:57.730
So you're still getting a workout,

435
00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.920
