480
00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.410
So I've gone out, like I did a six hour ride the other day

481
00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:49.220
maybe two weeks ago and still had plenty of power to go

482
00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:50.640
when I was done.

483
00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:52.410
Cool, that's fun,

484
00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.243
Yeah, super fun.

485
00:19:53.243 --> 00:19:56.990
So I've been doing that and also amping up

486
00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.890
