00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.660
but it's essentially all outdoors

492
00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.470
and with with masks and all the equipment is like spaced out

493
00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:17.680
over like a very large lot

494
00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:19.870
and I've been hitting that like a couple of times a week.

495
00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:22.240
So that's been my thing a little bit less running,

496
00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.233
I haven't been swimming very much.

497
00:20:23.233 --> 00:20:26.147
I mean, the pools are tricky to get into right now.

498
00:20:27.518 --> 00:20:28.910
And the ocean is cold.

499
00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:29.920
Ocean is cold, yeah.

500
00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:32.190
I was with my friend Drew the other day

501
00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:35.520
and he's been out swimming and he just, with a wetsuit,

