00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:48.730
One of our friends, watches had 51 earlier in the week.

506
00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:52.077
I wasn't out that day, but it's been cold.

507
00:20:52.077 --> 00:20:57.043
Yeah, I'm gonna wait until it's about maybe 59.

508
00:20:57.043 --> 00:20:59.640
(indistinct)

