00:52:28.550 --> 00:52:31.933
within the sober living house and he was running it.

1172
00:52:33.320 --> 00:52:34.153
Like unbelievable.

1173
00:52:34.153 --> 00:52:35.930
Yeah, so that's how bad it was.

