1220
00:54:45.500 --> 00:54:49.920
Like the idea is you detox, then you have inpatient

1221
00:54:49.920 --> 00:54:52.450
and then you have outpatient and for a lot of people

1222
00:54:52.450 --> 00:54:54.790
