1228
00:55:07.770 --> 00:55:11.420
So to the extent that we can craft and create

1229
00:55:12.800 --> 00:55:15.730
some regulatory oversight

1230
00:55:15.730 --> 00:55:18.200
over how these things are conducted

1231
00:55:18.200 --> 00:55:19.790
to make sure that people are safe

1232
00:55:19.790 --> 00:55:21.680
and that they're fulfilling their intention

1233
00:55:21.680 --> 00:55:23.630
