was because they didn't wanna be a lot of red tape

1238
00:55:35.780 --> 00:55:38.250
because the more red tape, the more likely

1239
00:55:38.250 --> 00:55:39.630
that someone in the neighborhood would find out

1240
00:55:39.630 --> 00:55:42.547
there was a sober living house now in their neighborhood.

1241
00:55:42.547 --> 00:55:43.659
Yes and they're not in my backyard.

1242
00:55:43.659 --> 00:55:48.659
It would be a NB thing, and so there are good intentions

1243
00:55:48.970 --> 00:55:51.520
that created this situation like Obamacare,

1244
00:55:51.520 --> 00:55:53.670
trying to get mental health and drug addiction,

1245
