recovery mandatory for these insurers,

1246
00:55:56.920 --> 00:55:57.940
that's a great intention.

1247
00:55:57.940 --> 00:56:01.660
And it can be considered a preexisting condition.

1248
00:56:01.660 --> 00:56:03.610
Right, and then sober living houses

1249
00:56:03.610 --> 00:56:05.920
the intention was to make a discreet

1250
00:56:05.920 --> 00:56:08.770
so that they could exist.

1251
00:56:08.770 --> 00:56:12.060
But the tragic thing is that you have addicts

