1323
00:59:11.190 --> 00:59:13.490
with the Bill Simmons Ringer deal,

1324
00:59:13.490 --> 00:59:14.660
it's incredible what they're doing

1325
00:59:14.660 --> 00:59:15.850
They've really stepped up.

1326
00:59:15.850 --> 00:59:17.880
