But when they have a podcast on,

1342
01:00:15.390 --> 01:00:18.140
if they're listening to Joe Rogan for three hours

1343
01:00:18.140 --> 01:00:21.580
they're on Spotify for three hours listening to ads

1344
01:00:21.580 --> 01:00:22.680
