It's basically like Netflix for podcasting.

1360
01:01:04.910 --> 01:01:07.603
Right, so crazy.
Good on them.

1361
01:01:08.490 --> 01:01:10.490
You had some other insights into this,

1362
01:01:11.370 --> 01:01:13.820
you're reading something right before we went on,

1363
01:01:15.450 --> 01:01:18.780
how does this help or hurt kind of podcasting going forward?

1364
01:01:18.780 --> 01:01:20.431
What was your takeaway on that?

