1404
01:03:03.500 --> 01:03:06.810
So if you're just looking at trying to grab attention share

1405
01:03:06.810 --> 01:03:10.787
in the attention economy, when there's Netflix and Hulu

1406
01:03:12.300 --> 01:03:15.470
