called it almost certainly the best bookstore

1676
01:14:56.820 --> 01:14:58.010
in the United States.

1677
01:14:58.010 --> 01:15:01.827
For me, it is, like it's kind of a landmark.

1678
01:15:01.827 --> 01:15:02.660
It's a historic landmark.

1679
01:15:02.660 --> 01:15:03.493
A landmark, a Holy temple.

1680
01:15:03.493 --> 01:15:05.450
It's an icon of a time.

