01:15:05.450 --> 01:15:07.993
Yes, a Holy temple of mad men and people

1682
01:15:08.865 --> 01:15:12.010
who are looking for truth in this world.

1683
01:15:12.010 --> 01:15:15.560
And basically he started the bookstore

1684
