within a couple of years and it was just all paperbacks

1685
01:15:17.730 --> 01:15:19.000
and at a time when paperbacks

1686
01:15:19.000 --> 01:15:20.590
weren't really being sold too much.

1687
01:15:20.590 --> 01:15:22.240
So he started this paperback bookstore,

1688
01:15:22.240 --> 01:15:25.890
and because of that, it was like he, things were cheap

1689
01:15:25.890 --> 01:15:27.650
and he acquired a bunch of people

1690
01:15:27.650 --> 01:15:29.610
coming to San Francisco and they showed up

1691
01:15:29.610 --> 01:15:31.610
at his doorstep and a lot of them were poets.

1692
01:15:31.610 --> 01:15:32.960
And then within a couple of years

1693
