one million copies in print.

1752
01:18:06.010 --> 01:18:09.340
And so the legend was built right around that era.

1753
01:18:09.340 --> 01:18:12.120
And what I think is what's one of the things

1754
01:18:12.120 --> 01:18:14.670
he used to say is when life gets too awful

1755
01:18:14.670 --> 01:18:15.950
