1758
01:18:21.960 --> 01:18:24.290
it could be running, swimming, diving,

1759
01:18:24.290 --> 01:18:26.910
reach for a piece of mind, that's the lyric escape.

1760
01:18:26.910 --> 01:18:29.110
And to me, City Lights was a lyric escape,

1761
01:18:29.110 --> 01:18:31.496
every time I entered that building.

