01:18:42.000 --> 01:18:45.530
It wasn't just about reading a great book,

1767
01:18:45.530 --> 01:18:48.010
it was a reading, a great book that allowed you

1768
01:18:48.010 --> 01:18:51.510
to look for that expansion of your own self.

